  "description": "Euonia 消息总线抽象：消息信封与上下文、约定、传输策略、注解、可靠性契约（Outbox、Inbox 与死信）及事件体系，是所有 Euonia 总线传输的扩展基础。 / Messaging abstractions for Euonia: message envelopes and contexts, conventions, transport strategies, annotations, reliability contracts (outbox, inbox and dead letter) and the event system. Extension base for all Euonia bus transports.",
